  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Details about resource onboarding status across all connectors.
            OnboardedByOtherConnector - this resource has
            already been onboarded to another connector. This is only applicable to
            top-level resources.              Onboarded - this resource has already
            been onboarded by the specified connector.              NotOnboarded -
            this resource has not been onboarded to any connector.
            NotApplicable - the onboarding state is not applicable to the
            current endpoint.
            </summary>
    <remarks>To be added.</remarks>
